# Secrets for local development (config vars go in wrangler.jsonc).
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your values; .dev.vars is gitignored.

# Shared secret the origin requires as X-Origin-Secret. Without it, every
# request is refused. Set in production with `wrangler secret bulk`.
ORIGIN_SECRET=

# No facilitator credentials needed: GoPlausible authenticates nothing and
# settles Algorand Mainnet and Testnet from one URL.
#   curl -s 'https://facilitator.goplausible.xyz/supported?format=json'
